<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA buys 52,500T of Argentine corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA buys 52,500T of Argentine corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feed Association (KFA) bought 52,500 tonnes of Argentine corn at $153.50 per tonne on a cost and freight basis on Tuesday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said Andre won the contract with shipment for June 11-30 to the southeastern port cities of Pusan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
